message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite it as below. This is an independent
  replication and extension of "Healthspan-lifespan gap differs in magnitude
  and disease contribution across world regions" (Garmany and Terzic,
  Communications Medicine, 2025,
  https://www.nature.com/articles/s43856-025-01111-2) -- to cite the original
  findings, cite that paper directly instead (see README for details).
title: >-
  GapYears: A Partial Replication and 2021 Extension of "Healthspan-Lifespan
  Gap Differs in Magnitude and Disease Contribution Across World Regions"
